{
 "duration": 25.565,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Cold night at the campground.",
   "start": 0.4,
   "end": 1.942
  },
  {
   "text": "Mia's fingers were numb, and the camp stove was right there.",
   "start": 2.392,
   "end": 5.655
  },
  {
   "text": "She started to bring it into the tent to warm up.",
   "start": 6.105,
   "end": 8.412
  },
  {
   "text": "Her friend stopped her.",
   "start": 8.862,
   "end": 9.993
  },
  {
   "text": "A fuel stove or heater inside a tent can fill it with carbon monoxide, and you can't see it or smell it.",
   "start": 10.443,
   "end": 17.113
  },
  {
   "text": "Instead: a warm drink outside, dry socks, a hat, and a sleeping pad under the bag.",
   "start": 17.563,
   "end": 22.981
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your next camping trip.",
   "start": 23.431,
   "end": 25.365
  }
 ],
